{"status":"unsupported_domain","reason":"A faithful executable contract for the frozen obligations is outside the specified typed AST frontend.","gaps":[{"obligations":["D1","O4","O5","O6","I1"],"detail":"The AST has no nullable integer sort or supported nullable-value elimination. Encoding null as Unit and integers through result constructors would require specified JSON null adaptation and result elimination that this frontend does not provide."},{"obligations":["O2","O6"],"detail":"The frontend explicitly excludes sorting and provides neither lexicographic string comparison nor a sorting primitive. It cannot express the required sorted distinct Unicode group names."},{"obligations":["O3","O6"],"detail":"The frontend has no range-generation primitive, recursion, or integer division to construct the arbitrarily long bucket-start progression from start, end, and width."},{"obligations":["O1","R1"],"detail":"The supplied formula grammar does not express Python source location, standard-library-only dependencies, or absence of external I/O and observable side effects."}],"preserved_obligations":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6","O7","I1","R1"],"proposal":null}